# MASTER BUILD PROMPT — PREMIUM ACADEMIC INTEGRITY SAAS PLATFORM

## 1. ROLE AND MISSION

Act as a world-class SaaS product architect, senior full-stack engineer, UX/UI designer, AI engineer, database architect, and cybersecurity specialist.

Your mission is to design and build a complete, production-oriented SaaS platform for academic integrity verification.

The platform must provide two independent but integrated analysis capabilities:

1. **Academic Plagiarism Detection:** Detect textual similarities, direct copying, paraphrasing, and similarities with accessible reference sources and authorized institutional document collections.
2. **AI-Generated Content Detection:** Analyze academic documents to identify passages whose linguistic characteristics are statistically associated with AI-generated content.

The product should deliver a premium user experience inspired by the usability of Linear, the dashboard quality of Stripe, and the academic analysis experience of Turnitin and Copyleaks.

IMPORTANT: Do not build only a landing page or a static dashboard. Build a complete multi-page SaaS application with real navigation, reusable components, functional interactions, authentication architecture, database integration, role-based permissions, and all major user workflows.

The application must be scalable, modular, secure, multilingual, and ready for future integration of proprietary AI detection engines.

